          <caption>
            <p>Plaque Psoriasis: Multiple Erythematous Scaly Plaques Over the Back. Plaque psoriasis presents as well-demarcated, erythematous plaques with overlying silvery-white scales, commonly distributed across the back. Contributed by S Mehta, MD</p>
