          <caption>
            <p>Plantar Psoriasis: Isolated Hyperkeratotic Scaly Plaque With Fissuring Over the Sole. Plantar psoriasis presents as an isolated hyperkeratotic scaly plaque with fissuring over the sole, distinguished by sharply marginated borders. Contributed by S Mehta, MD</p>
